ed to give her a lift.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/71e2.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>true</isExample><modelAnswerString /></question></question_xml><enableAudioOnChecked>false</enableAudioOnChecked><enableAudioOnClosed>false</enableAudioOnClosed><correctFeedback_str /><incorrectFeedback_str /><attemptsAllowed>1</attemptsAllowed></mcq_xml></params_xml><alignment>left</alignment><alignPercent>72</alignPercent><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="checked" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="closed" visible="True" enabled="False" /></states></params></object><object linkID="image_viewer"><params><isAnimation>false</isAnimation><showIcon>none</showIcon><url_str>learning_objects/assets/aw7jpg.jpg</url_str><showBorder>true</showBorder><title_str /><description_str /><alt_text_str /><instruct_str /><instruct_panel_str>If you are unsure about how the animation above works click the "Instructions" button for help</instruct_panel_str><instruct_btn_str>INSTRUCTIONS</instruct_btn_str><alignment>right</alignment><alignPercent>28</alignPercent><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="checked" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="closed" visible="True" enabled="False" /></states></params></object><object linkID="spacer"><params><params_xml><useHeight>true</useHeight><height>30</height></params_xml></params></object><object linkID="texttoitem_var1"><params><params_xml><mcq_xml isMarked="false" isActivity="true"><at_heading>Text to Item</at_heading><instruction_str /><attemptsFailFeedback_str>The interaction will now be completed for you.</attemptsFailFeedback_str><attemptsRemain_xml>&lt;text&gt;You have &lt;/text&gt;&lt;val id="attempts"/&gt;&lt;choose id="attempts"&gt;&lt;sgl&gt; attempt&lt;/sgl&gt;&lt;pl&gt; attempts&lt;/pl&gt;&lt;/choose&gt;&lt;text&gt; remaining.&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/attemptsRemain_xml&gt;</attemptsRemain_xml><multiAnswerFeedback_xml>&lt;text&gt;You got &lt;/text&gt;&lt;val id="score"/&gt;&lt;text&gt; out of &lt;/text&gt;&lt;val id="total"/&gt;&lt;text&gt; correct.&lt;/text&gt;</multiAnswerFeedback_xml><markedFeedback_xml>&lt;text&gt;You got &lt;/text&gt;&lt;val id="percent"/&gt;&lt;text&gt;% for this marked interaction.&lt;/text&gt;</markedFeedback_xml><showPrefix>true</showPrefix><prefixActivityLevel>false</prefixActivityLevel><prefixStartIndex /><showPrefixes>false</showPrefixes><blankMinWidth>200</blankMinWidth><blankMaxWidth>650</blankMaxWidth><question_xml><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>I would certainly have gone with Pete to Thailand if I [hadn't been taking] my final exams soon. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/711.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>I would certainly have gone with Pete to Thailand if I &lt;b&gt;hadn't been taking&lt;/b&gt; my final exams soon. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>I was shocked when I heard that Kate and Jan were splitting up. I thought they [had been getting|'d been getting] on a lot better recently.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/712.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>I was shocked when I heard that Kate and Jan were splitting up. I thought they &lt;b&gt;had been getting&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;'d been getting&lt;/b&gt; on a lot better recently.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>I [had been looking|'d been looking] forward to the party all week, so I was very disappointed when it was cancelled. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/713.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>I &lt;b&gt;had been looking&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;'d been looking&lt;/b&gt; forward to the party all week, so I was very disappointed when it was cancelled. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>As Carol showed me around the village, I found that she [hadn't been exaggerating] about what a wonderful place it was. It was indeed beautiful. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/714.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>As Carol showed me around the village, I found that she &lt;b&gt;hadn't been exaggerating&lt;/b&gt; about what a wonderful place it was. It was indeed beautiful. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>I was so relieved when we reached Gothenburg. I [had been feeling|'d been feeling] very seasick during the crossing.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/715.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>I was so relieved when we reached Gothenburg. I &lt;b&gt;had been feeling&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;'d been feeling&lt;/b&gt; very seasick during the crossing.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>We were surprised when Clara and Joseph turned up. We [hadn't been expecting] them until the following day.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/716.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>We were surprised when Clara and Joseph turned up. We &lt;b&gt;hadn't been expecting&lt;/b&gt; them until the following day.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>When Pablo picked up his tablet computer, I realised that he [hadn't been listening] to a word I'd said about spending too much time online. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/717.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>When Pablo picked up his tablet computer, I realised that he &lt;b&gt;hadn't been listening&lt;/b&gt; to a word I'd said about spending too much time online. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>I remembered  exactly what she [had been wearing|'d been wearing] when I first saw her.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/718.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>I remembered  exactly what she &lt;b&gt;had been wearing&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;'d been wearing&lt;/b&gt; when I first saw her.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>A man walked right out in front of the car, and it would have hit him if the traffic [hadn't been moving] slowly.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/719.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>A man walked right out in front of the car, and it would have hit him if the traffic &lt;b&gt;hadn't been moving&lt;/b&gt; slowly.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>Sara woke up with a jump. She [had been dreaming|'d been dreaming] that she was being chased by a tiger and had tripped over. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7110.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>Sara woke up with a jump. She &lt;b&gt;had been dreaming&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;'d been dreaming&lt;/b&gt; that she was being chased by a tiger and had tripped over. </modelAnswerString></question></question_xml><enableAudioOnChecked>false</enableAudioOnChecked><enableAudioOnClosed>true</enableAudioOnClosed><correctFeedback_str /><incorrectFeedback_str /><attemptsAllowed>1</attemptsAllowed></mcq_xml></params_xml><alignment>none</alignment><alignPercent>100</alignPercent><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="checked" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="closed" visible="True" enabled="True" /></states></params></object><object linkID="ba